27620      title 'Gasoline and Emissions Data';
27621      data gas;
27622      set sashelp.gas;
27623      if fuel in ('Ethanol', '82rongas', 'Gasohol');
27624      run;

NOTE: There were 171 observations read from the data set SASHELP.GAS.
NOTE: The data set WORK.GAS has 112 observations and 4 variables.

27625      ods graphics on;
27626      * Request a Spline Transformation of Equivalence Ratio;
27627      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 plots=(transformation obp residuals);
27628      model identity(nox) = spline(EqRatio / nknots=4);
27629      run;

NOTE: 2 observations were deleted from the analysis due to missing values.
NOTE: Algorithm converged.
NOTE: There were 112 observations read from the data set WORK.GAS.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE TRANSREG printed page 1696.

27630      * Separate Curves and Intercepts;
27631      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 additive plots=(transformation obp);
27632      model identity(nox) = class(Fuel / zero=none) |
27633      spline(EqRatio / nknots=4 after);
27634      run;

NOTE: Since the model contains SMOOTH, BSPLINE, PBSPLINE, or a CLASS expansion with ZERO=NONE, a model with an implicit intercept is fit.
NOTE: All statistics are mean corrected.
NOTE: 2 observations were deleted from the analysis due to missing values.
NOTE: Algorithm converged.
